{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.GramIndefinite","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.GramIndefinite","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HeckeH3","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing","lean:module:QOU.Interactions.BorromeanUnique"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.gram_indefinite_witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.gram_indefinite_witness","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/GramIndefinite.lean#L186-L233","doc":"The vector v = e₃ - e₄ (i.e., L₊ − L₋) witnesses\nindefiniteness of the Gram form.\n\nvᵀGv = G₃₃ - 2G₃₄ + G₄₄ = 2(z²(1+HA²) + HAz) - 2(1+2HAz+HA²z²)\n= 2z² - 2HAz - 2 = 2(z² - HAz - 1).\n\nFor q > 1: z < 1/2 and HA > 0, so z² < 1/4 and\nz² - HAz - 1 < 1/4 - 0 - 1 < 0.\n\nTherefore vᵀGv < 0 and G is NOT positive semidefinite. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-topological","label":"prop:confinement-topological","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/confinement-topological.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus_mul_hopfMinus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus_mul_hopfMinus","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/GramIndefinite.lean#L159-L181","doc":"L₊·L₋ = σ₀σ₁·σ₁σ₀ = 1 + HA·σ₀ + HA·e⁻.\n\nσ₀σ₁σ₁σ₀ = σ₀·(HA·σ₁+1)·σ₀ = HA·σ₀σ₁σ₀ + σ₀²\n= HA·e⁻ + HA·σ₀ + 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus_sq","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/GramIndefinite.lean#L134-L157","doc":"L₊² = (σ₀σ₁)² reduces to L₋ + HA·e⁻ in H₃(q).\n\nσ₀σ₁σ₀σ₁ → (braid on σ₀σ₁σ₀) → σ₁σ₀σ₁·σ₁\n= σ₁σ₀·σ₁² = σ₁σ₀·(HA·σ₁+1) = HA·e⁻ + L₋.\n\nIn the standard 2×2 representation: ","signatureChunk":0}]}